(Each call to fork\(\) doubles the number of active processes. Starting with 1 parent process:) Tj
T* (After 1st fork: 2^1 = 2 processes.) Tj
T* (After 2nd fork: 2^2 = 4 processes.) Tj
T* (After 3rd fork: 2^3 = 8 processes.) Tj
T* (Total processes running = 8. Total NEW child processes created = 8 - 1 = 7.) Tj
